      "text": "```\nARTIST                          ARCHITECT\n────────                        ──────────\nPrimary medium: paint, stone,   Primary medium: building materials,\n  metal, print, performance       space, structure\nProduct: portable object or     Product: built environment; permanent,\n  fixed surface                   functional, public\nTraining: workshop/atelier      Training: mathematical, engineering\n  apprenticeship (historically)   + design (historically)\nPatronage: church, nobility,    Patronage: church, state, wealthy\n  then market                     patrons, then corporate/public\nTheory: beauty, expression,     Theory: proportion, function, structure,\n  representation                  light, urban context"
